<p>At Cameron &amp; Co, we are committed to protecting your privacy as an online visitor to our website. The information we collect about you is used to enhance the services we provide. We respect the privacy and confidentiality of your information and adhere to the Australian Privacy Principles.</p>
<p>You may update your details at any time by advising us in writing via email. All information we receive from our customers is protected by our secure server. Cameron &amp; Co’s secure server software encrypts all customer information before it is sent to us. Additionally, all customer data collected is safeguarded against unauthorised use or access. Credit card information is not stored on our servers.</p>
<h2>Storage and Security of Your Information</h2>
<p>We collect and store information you provide on our website or through other means. You may provide basic contact information, such as your name, phone number, address, and email address, to enable us to send information or process your product order. We may also collect additional information, including feedback, content or email preferences, survey responses, or communications with our customer support.</p>
<p>We may use your personal information to provide you with direct marketing material, website updates, and information via a newsletter. This applies only if you have registered or subscribed to such communications by providing your details. If you wish to stop receiving such information, you can let us know by email or unsubscribe at any time.</p>
<p>Individual profiles and company details are not used for any other purpose. Details are only supplied to third-party suppliers when required by law, for goods or services you have purchased, or to protect our copyright, trademarks, and other legal rights.</p>
<h2>Use of Personal Data</h2>
<p>We respect the privacy of our online visitors. We may collect information through this website that can personally identify you, including information you voluntarily provide when asking questions, commenting, or subscribing to e-newsletters.</p>
<p>We take reasonable steps to protect the confidentiality of your personal data. We will not knowingly share it with third parties other than service providers who assist us in delivering information or services you have requested. Some service providers may be located overseas and may not be subject to Australian privacy laws. Please contact us if you require specific details.</p>
<p>Any non-personal information, communications, and material you send to this website or to us by email, or which we obtain from third parties without promises of confidentiality, may be retained, used, and disclosed by us on a non-confidential basis. We may use and reproduce such information freely and for any purpose, including developing, manufacturing, or marketing products.</p>
<h2>Cookies</h2>
<p>Our website uses cookies to analyse website traffic and help provide a better visitor experience. Cookies do not access personal information such as your name, address, or email address. You can reject cookies through your browser settings, although this may prevent you from fully using the website.</p>
<h2>Disclosure of Your Information</h2>
<p>We may disclose personal data where required by law, court order, subpoena, warrant, or law-enforcement request, or where necessary to protect the rights, property, or safety of Cameron &amp; Co, our customers, or third parties. In the event of a change of control, customer information may be disclosed to a potential purchaser under a confidentiality agreement.</p>
<h2>Third Parties and Security</h2>
<p>We do not sell or trade personal or customer information. We may use de-identified information to create marketing statistics, identify user demands, and improve our website and services. We periodically update our security measures in line with current technologies.</p>
<p>We may use your information in a general sense, without reference to your name, to create marketing statistics, identify user demands, and assist in meeting customer needs.</p>
<h2>Links</h2>
<p>Links to third-party websites do not constitute sponsorship, endorsement, or approval. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of other websites. This privacy policy applies solely to information collected by this website.</p>
<h2>Changes to this Privacy Policy</h2>
<p>This policy may be modified at any time, with changes effective immediately upon posting. If you have questions or concerns, contact us at <a href="mailto:vicsales@cameronco.com.au">vicsales@cameronco.com.au</a>.</p>
